  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Brand introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Our mission</strong></p>\r\n<p>Asorock (AR) Fragrances believes everyone should smell their best and we set out to make that a reality by providing premium fragrances available for everyone at unbeatable prices.</p>\r\n<p>As fragrance connoisseurs and socially conscious individuals, we realized, just as we did with the watch marker, that perfumes were being sold for way more than they cost to make and &nbsp;we couldn&rsquo;t turn a blind eye to the price markup of the industry. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong></p>\r\n<p>All Asorock perfumes are crafted as extrait de parfums, meaning they are long lasting scents which have a 30-40% concentration of fragrance oil and are among the most highly concentrated fragrances in the market. We source our fragrance oils from France, and blend here in the USA, which has been a global leader in the production and development of original luxury fragrances.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Blended in the USA</p>\r\n<p>👌🏽 Extrait De Parfum</p>\r\n<p>🍃All AR Fragrances are vegan, cruelty free, and made using 100% clean ingredients.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<p>Based in Chicago, we started out with a mission to create luxury quality fragrances without the high markups. We strive to create the best customer experience possible, and we are always listening and learning from customer feedback.</p>\r\n<p>All our bottles are Extrait de Parfum. For reference of the concentration, see below:</p>\r\n<p>After shave: 1-3% Aromatic Compounds<br>Eau de Cologne: 2-6% Aromatic Compounds<br>Eau de Toilette: 5-15% Aromatic Compounds<br>Eau de Parfum: 10-20% Aromatic Compounds<br>Extrait De Parfum: 30-40% Aromatic Componds</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Credit/debit card, prepaid, paypal, applepay, afterpay and klarna<br><br></p>",
